pools and gym as my guests before and after the charter. David, Owner", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, Fl.", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT ACTION REQUIRED\nSix Fins Charter – Reef Snorkel Charter Confirmation\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe’re excited to welcome you aboard your Private Reef Snorkel Charter — a 4-hour adventure to the world-famous Key West coral reef.\n\nPlease review the important details below to ensure a smooth and unforgettable experience.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n✅ Before Your Trip\n\nFor trips up to six passengers:\n\n👉 Each passenger must complete the insurance waiver (including adults on behalf of minors): [here] (https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/rd9k5tiavpwper7h2rhaqh/web/)\n\nAND for trips with 7th and 8th passengers:\n\n👉 The primary renter (21+ years old) and captain must complete the Bareboat Agreement together at the dock before departure, but prior to arrival, you may begin: [here](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/ez5636zbxexwrng7dtz6mq/web/)\n\nPlease complete all forms prior to arrival so we can depart on time.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🌊 Your Reef Snorkel Experience\n\nThis is a private 4-hour offshore snorkeling charter to the Florida Keys Reef Tract — North America’s only living barrier reef.\n\nPossible reef locations include:\n\n• Western Sambo Reef\n• Eastern Dry Rocks (near the Christ of the Abyss statue)\n• Sand Key Reef\n• Rock Key\n• Cottrell Key patch reefs\n\nYour captain selects the optimal location based on weather, visibility, and sea conditions.\n\nAfter a safety and snorkel orientation, you’ll explore vibrant coral formations, tropical fish, rays, and other marine life in crystal-clear waters — without the crowds of large tour boats.\n\nSnorkeling is optional. Guests may relax onboard at any time.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🛥 Departure Details\n\nDock A, Slip #32\n7001 Shrimp Rd\nStock Island, FL 33040\n\nFree parking is available adjacent to The Perry Hotel & Marina.\nPlease arrive 15 minutes before departure.\n\nBoat:\n30' Jeanneau NC 895 Weekender\nPrivate enclosed head (toilet)\nUSCG-certified safety equipment\nLicensed USCG captains\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🧳 What’s Included\n\n• Snorkel gear\n• Cooler with ice\n• Bottled water & light snacks\n• Adult noodles\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🚫 Not Included\n\n• Meals & beverages\n• Towels\n• Infant/toddler USCG-approved life jackets (must be provided by guest)\n• Captain & crew gratuity (customary 20% minimum if satisfied)\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🩺 Health & Safety\n\nYour safety is our highest priority.\n\n• Operated by U.S. Coast Guard–licensed captains\n• Safety briefing and snorkel orientation provided\n• Life jackets available for all guests\n• Snorkel sites selected based on current conditions\n• Food allergies or dietary restrictions: reply to this email and let us know in advance so we can prepare.\n• Prone to seasickness: tell us ahead of time and we'll suggest what to take before boarding.\n\nSnorkeling is an open-water activity. Guests should be comfortable swimming in ocean conditions, including potential currents and waves.\n\nNot recommended for guests who are pregnant or those with serious heart, respiratory, neck/back, or recent surgical conditions.\n\nExcessive intoxication or unsafe behavior may result in denial of boarding or early termination without refund.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n⚠ Disclaimers\n\n• All itineraries are subject to weather, visibility, and captain discretion\n• Marine life sightings cannot be guaranteed\n• Reef clarity varies daily\n• Late arrivals may reduce charter time\n• Six Fins is not responsible for lost or damaged personal items\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🎁 Complimentary Access\n\nAs my charter guests, you may enjoy access to The Perry Hotel & Marina pools and fitness center before and after your trip.\n\nMake it a full Keys day.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\nWe look forward to hosting your private reef adventure.\n\nBest regards,\n\nDavid McFadden\nOwner, Six Fins Charter", "cancellation_notes": "Enjoy peace of mind with our cancellation policy:\n\nAll reservations made within 7 calendar days of departure are non-refundable. Customer cancellations made prior to 7 calendar days before departure will receive a full refund. If Six Fins Charter cancels due to unsafe weather conditions or other circumstances initiated by the owner/operator, the customer will receive a full refund.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "A dedicated reef day on the 30' Jeanneau yacht", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532224/images/1157959/", "pk": 1157959, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nZOAr70bR8yPM5lbbwiq", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nZOAr70bR8yPM5lbbwiq", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532224/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nZOAr70bR8yPM5lbbwiq", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nZOAr70bR8yPM5lbbwiq", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532224/images/1228427/", "pk": 1228427, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UifQzOXyQ8q4MWmormiA", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/UifQzOXyQ8q4MWmormiA", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532224/"}, "crop": {}, "croppe